  "content": "<p>此模组为Railcraft Reborn增添鋼軌與鐵路的原聲配方</p>\n<p>原版鐵軌製作</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_809f258f-37f1-4088-b297-99033016a2d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"144\"></p>\n<p>電梯鐵軌製作</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a4969615-b91e-42e8-af9c-86c26b5d6cdf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p>電氣鐵軌製作</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ee063670-543b-482b-bc81-14e5abeba861.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"144\"></p>\n<p>高速鐵軌製作</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2500c68c-0938-4dff-b923-c0a5a565da06.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"142\"></p>\n<p>高速電氣鐵軌製作</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_962ceff1-51c4-4a98-bbf7-f3b670a3afb7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p>加固鐵軌製作</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0e6ec7f0-c5a7-4c0b-9d7e-90e4b7cc1c6b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p>於原版高爐中透過冶煉鐵錠或打火石獲得鋼錠</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1385341/description_e0855fd1-b3f3-493f-865c-7da217f9c8ad.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"203\"></p>\n<p>針對岔道、交會道及轉轍道的工具套裝配方</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1385341/description_3f1b57c1-92b8-4f74-b2c6-b1ca5994f4d7.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p>使用製作者工作台製作塵埃變體</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1385341/description_9ffee205-41de-4179-9279-26fe104a65ef.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>相容於JEI與Brickfurnace</p>\n<p>需要： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/railcraft-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Railcraft Reborn</a></p>\n<p>使用MCreator開發</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
